<title>UK: KFW unit sets 700 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW unit sets 700 mln Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers CSFB and Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE INC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    700 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50 PCT  MATURITY    15.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.625   PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
